## Residual risks (register)

| ID | Sev | Residual | Close when |
|----|-----|----------|------------|
| R2-S1 | MED | Symlink / relative path loads arbitrary readable files without `..` | realpath + stay-under-root or O_NOFOLLOW on import open |
| R2-S2 | MED | `oodac_concat.sh` lacks import-name ZT (abs allowed) | port reject_bad_import_name or delete concat path |
| R2-S3 | MED | `emit-c` alone does not refuse residual free names (`import_c`) | run residual check before emit, or require check gate |
| R2-S4 | LOW | `import ""` not rejected as bad import name | parse empty quoted name → reject_bad |
| R2-S5 | LOW | NUL may truncate before explicit NUL refuse message | preserve NULs in parse or reject at lexer |
| R2-S6 | LOW | Issue #9 expanded LINE (not per-file) | line_base / path markers in expand |
| R2-S7 | LOW | `../std` CWD-coupled std probes | EnvCap + OODA_STD_PATH or pin std root |
| R2-S8 | note | Cross-file SECRET interproc still residual (T1) | full return/taint lattice (out of R2 OWN) |
| R2-S9 | LOW | Partial preamble on emit before import ERR | emit preamble after successful load |

